# DOMAIN MODEL

## Entities

### Task
A Task has:
- id: integer
- title: string
- status: "open" | "done"

## Rules
- Task ids should be unique.
- A newly created task must start with status "open".
- Only existing tasks can be marked done.


[docs/INVARIANTS.md]
# INVARIANTS

- Task ids must be unique.
- `createTask` must not mutate prior task objects.
- `markDone` must only change the matching task.
- `listTasks(tasks, status)` must only return tasks with that exact status.


[docs/ARCHITECTURE.md]
# ARCHITECTURE

## Scope
This is a small TypeScript test project used to validate an AI-assisted engineering workflow.

## Structure
- `starter-test/src/tasks.ts`: domain logic
- `starter-test/src/index.ts`: demo entry point
- `starter-test/tests/tasks.test.ts`: tests

